Lugupeetud domeeni <%= @domain.name %> registreerija/halduskontakt

Eesti Interneti Sihtasutusele (EIS) on Rahvastikuregistri andmetel saanud teatavaks, et füüsiline isik isikukoodiga <%= @registrant.id_code %> on surnud ja sellest on möödunud enam kui 6 kuud.

Tulenevalt .ee domeenireeglitest (https://www.internet.ee/domeenid/ee-domeenireeglid) ei saa surnud isik olla domeeni registreerijaks - seetõttu algatati domeeni <%= @domain.name %> osas kustutusmenetlus.

Domeeni suhtes õigust omaval isikul on võimalus esitada registripidajale <%= @registrar.name %> domeeni üleandmise taotlus, millele tuleb lisada pärimisõiguse tõend. Registreerimise andmed tuleb parandada hiljemalt <%= @domain.force_delete_last_day %>.

Juhul, kui üleandmine ei ole selle aja jooksul toimunud, läheb domeen <%= @domain.force_delete_date %> domeenioksjonile .ee oksjonikeskkonda https://auction.internet.ee. Kui domeen ei leia oksjoni vahendusel uut omanikku, vabaneb see kõigile registreerimiseks "kes ees, see mees" põhimõttel.

Lisaküsimuste korral võtke palun ühendust oma registripidajaga:
<%= render 'mailers/shared/registrar/registrar.et.text', registrar: @registrar %>

<%= render 'mailers/shared/signatures/signature.et.text' %>

--------------------------------------

Dear registrant/administrative contact of <%= @domain.name %> domain,

According to the Estonian Population Register, the Estonian Internet Foundation (EIF) has been informed that the natural person with personal identification code <%= @registrant.id_code %> has passed away and that more than 6 months have passed since then.

According to the .ee Domain Regulation (https://www.internet.ee/domains/ee-domain-regulation), a deceased person cannot be the registrant of a domain. Therefore, EIF has started the deletion process of the domain <%= @domain.name %>.

A person entitled to the domain can submit a domain transfer application to the registrar <%= @registrar.name %>, together with proof of the right of succession. The registration must be transferred by <%= @domain.force_delete_last_day %> at the latest.

If the transfer has not been completed by then, the domain will go to auction on <%= @domain.force_delete_date %> in the .ee auction environment https://auction.internet.ee. If the domain does not find a new owner through the auction, it becomes available for registration to anyone on a first-come, first-served basis.

Should you have additional questions, please contact your registrar:
<%= render 'mailers/shared/registrar/registrar.en.text', registrar: @registrar %>

<%= render 'mailers/shared/signatures/signature.en.text' %>
